  "html": "<section data-home-part=\"first-screen\" id=\"u-opening\" class=\"opening u-opening\" aria-labelledby=\"u-headline\"><div class=\"opening-copy\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Keep what sticks.</span><h1 id=\"u-headline\">Uoink that shit.</h1><p>Save what you watch. Your AI writes from it, with receipts.</p><a class=\"button primary rust\" href=\"/install\">Get Uoink</a></div><div class=\"payoff-draft\"><div class=\"paper-label\"><span>{{example.label}}</span><span>{{example.threadLabel}}</span></div><ol class=\"receipt-thread\"><li data-claim=\"job\"><p>{{drafts.job}}</p><a class=\"citation receipt-chip\" href=\"#u-scene-1\" data-receipt=\"job\" aria-label=\"Open {{sources.lesson.label}} receipt: the job\">{{sources.lesson.label}}<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li data-claim=\"goal\"><p>{{drafts.goal}}</p><a class=\"citation receipt-chip\" href=\"#u-scene-1\" data-receipt=\"goal\" aria-label=\"Open {{sources.lesson.label}} receipt: the goal\">{{sources.lesson.label}}<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li data-claim=\"learn\"><p>{{drafts.learn}}</p><a class=\"citation receipt-chip\" href=\"#u-scene-1\" data-receipt=\"learn\" aria-label=\"Open {{sources.podcast.label}} receipt: the schedule\">{{sources.podcast.label}}<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ol></div><a class=\"scene-deeper\" data-scene-link=\"0\" href=\"/install\">Get Uoink <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><div class=\"opening-bottom\"><span>Tap a receipt.</span><a href=\"#u-scene-1\">Or scroll <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div></section><div data-home-part=\"film\" class=\"story-film\" id=\"u-film\" aria-label=\"Uoink loop engineering story\"><section class=\"scene-runway u-scene\" id=\"u-scene-1\" aria-labelledby=\"u-scene-title-1\" data-scene=\"u1\"><div class=\"scene-sticky receipt-scene\"><div class=\"scene-meta\"><span>Keep what sticks</span><span>01 / 07</span></div><div class=\"scene-body\"><h2 id=\"u-scene-title-1\">Every line knows where it came from.</h2><div class=\"receipt-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a thread receipt\"><button class=\"button secondary rust\" data-receipt-select=\"job\" aria-pressed=\"true\">The job</button><button class=\"button secondary rust\" data-receipt-select=\"goal\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The goal</button><button class=\"button secondary rust\" data-receipt-select=\"learn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The schedule</button></div><div class=\"receipt-browser\"><article class=\"receipt-detail\" data-receipt-card=\"job\" aria-label=\"{{sources.lesson.label}}: The job\"><div class=\"paper-label\"><span>{{sources.lesson.label}}</span><span>Saved source</span></div><div class=\"receipt-source\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape lesson\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>{{sources.lesson.publisher}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.lesson.title}}</h5><p>{{sources.lesson.date}} · {{sources.lesson.length}}</p></div><div class=\"minute-row\"><button class=\"receipt-jump\" data-jump=\"job\" aria-describedby=\"receipt-note-job\">Jump to {{sources.lesson.receipts.job.time}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button><span>from the transcript</span></div><div class=\"receipt-excerpt\" id=\"receipt-line-job\" tabindex=\"-1\"><small>{{example.notesLabel}}</small><p><mark data-source-quote=\"lesson.job\">{{sources.lesson.receipts.job.quote}}</mark></p></div><p class=\"receipt-note\" id=\"receipt-note-job\">{{drafts.minuteNote}}</p><div class=\"receipt-publisher\"><a class=\"citation\" href=\"{{sources.lesson.receipts.job.link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">[1] {{sources.lesson.label}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"receipt-detail\" data-receipt-card=\"goal\" aria-label=\"{{sources.lesson.label}}: The goal\"><div class=\"paper-label\"><span>{{sources.lesson.label}}</span><span>Saved source</span></div><div class=\"receipt-source\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape lesson\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>{{sources.lesson.publisher}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.lesson.title}}</h5><p>{{sources.lesson.date}} · {{sources.lesson.length}}</p></div><div class=\"minute-row\"><button class=\"receipt-jump\" data-jump=\"goal\" aria-describedby=\"receipt-note-goal\">Jump to {{sources.lesson.receipts.verify.time}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button><span>from the transcript</span></div><div class=\"receipt-excerpt\" id=\"receipt-line-goal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><small>{{example.notesLabel}}</small><p><mark data-source-quote=\"lesson.verify\">{{sources.lesson.receipts.verify.quote}}</mark></p></div><p class=\"receipt-note\" id=\"receipt-note-goal\">{{drafts.minuteNote}}</p><div class=\"receipt-publisher\"><a class=\"citation\" href=\"{{sources.lesson.receipts.verify.link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">[1] {{sources.lesson.label}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article><article class=\"receipt-detail\" data-receipt-card=\"learn\" aria-label=\"{{sources.podcast.label}}: The schedule\"><div class=\"paper-label\"><span>{{sources.podcast.label}}</span><span>Saved source</span></div><div class=\"receipt-source\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape podcast\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>{{sources.podcast.label}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.podcast.title}}</h5><p>{{sources.podcast.date}} · {{sources.podcast.length}}</p></div><div class=\"minute-row\"><button class=\"receipt-jump\" data-jump=\"learn\" aria-describedby=\"receipt-note-learn\">Jump to {{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.time}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button><span>from the transcript</span></div><div class=\"receipt-excerpt\" id=\"receipt-line-learn\" tabindex=\"-1\"><small>{{example.notesLabel}}</small><p><mark data-source-quote=\"podcast.schedule\">{{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.quote}}</mark></p></div><p class=\"receipt-note\" id=\"receipt-note-learn\">{{drafts.minuteNote}}</p><div class=\"receipt-publisher\"><a class=\"citation\" href=\"{{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">[2] {{sources.podcast.label}} <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></article></div><a class=\"back-to-draft\" href=\"#u-headline\">Back to the draft <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></a></div><div class=\"scene-links\"><a class=\"scene-deeper\" data-scene-link=\"1\" href=\"/features/evidence-panel\">How evidence cards work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"scene-next\" href=\"#u-scene-2\">Keep scrolling <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"scene-runway u-scene\" id=\"u-scene-2\" aria-labelledby=\"u-scene-title-2\" data-scene=\"u2\"><div class=\"scene-sticky source-scene rewind-scene\"><div class=\"scene-meta\"><span>Keep what sticks</span><span>02 / 07</span></div><div class=\"scene-body\"><h2 id=\"u-scene-title-2\">{{drafts.threeWeeks}}.</h2><div class=\"relative-calendar\" data-direction=\"back\"><span>Story time</span><div class=\"time-reel\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"{{drafts.threeWeeks}}\"><div class=\"time-reel-strip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>{{drafts.threeWeeks}}</span><span>{{drafts.twoWeeks}}</span><span>{{drafts.oneWeek}}</span><span>Today</span></div></div></div><p class=\"rewind-deck\">Everyone was talking about loop engineering.</p><div class=\"source-stack\"><article class=\"source-entry\" id=\"source-lesson\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape lesson\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Lesson</span><span class=\"source-length\">{{sources.lesson.length}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.lesson.title}}</h5><p>Boris Cherny · YC Startup School · {{sources.lesson.date}}</p><div class=\"source-quote-row\"><p class=\"source-quote\" data-source-quote=\"lesson.prompt\">{{sources.lesson.receipts.prompt.quote}}</p><a class=\"citation\" href=\"{{sources.lesson.receipts.prompt.link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">{{sources.lesson.receipts.prompt.time}} ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"source-entry\" id=\"source-podcast\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape podcast\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Podcast</span><span class=\"source-length\">{{sources.podcast.length}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.podcast.title}}</h5><p>How I AI · {{sources.podcast.date}}</p><div class=\"source-quote-row\"><p class=\"source-quote\" data-source-quote=\"podcast.schedule\">{{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.quote}}</p><a class=\"citation\" href=\"{{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.link}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">{{sources.podcast.receipts.schedule.time}} ↗</a></div></article><article class=\"source-entry\" id=\"source-x-video\"><div class=\"source-kind\"><span class=\"platform-shape pending\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span><span>X video</span><span class=\"source-length\">{{sources.x.length}}</span></div><h5>{{sources.x.title}}</h5><p>{{sources.x.note}} · {{sources.x.date}}</p><p class=\"source-summary\">{{sources.x.summary}}</p><a class=\"source-link\" href=\"{{sources.x.url}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Watch on X ↗</a></article></div><div class=\"time-cost\"><span class=\"clock-face\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span><div><strong><b id=\"known-runtime\">{{example.runtime}}</b> {{example.runtimeUnit}} <span>{{example.runtimeExtra}}</span></strong><p>No time for any of it.</p><small>{{example.runtimeNote}}</small></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-links\"><a class=\"scene-deeper\" data-scene-link=\"2\" href=\"/sources\">Everything Uoink can save <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"scene-next\" href=\"#u-scene-3\">Keep scrolling <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"scene-runway u-scene\" id=\"u-scene-3\" aria-labelledby=\"u-scene-title-3\" data-scene=\"u3\"><div class=\"scene-sticky magnet-scene\"><div class=\"scene-meta\"><span>Keep what sticks</span><span>03 / 07</span></div><div class=\"scene-body\"><h2 id=\"u-scene-title-3\">Uoink it.</h2><p class=\"scene-deck\">Keep the idea. Get on with your day.</p><div class=\"magnet-demo\"><div class=\"story-magnet\"><svg class=\"brand-mark\" data-brand=\"u\" data-cap=\"124\" data-ground=\"cream\" width=\"124\" height=\"124\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Uoink magnet\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path class=\"letter-body-path\" fill=\"#C2410C\" d=\"M 0 0 L 32 0 L 32 60 L 68 60 L 68 0 L 100 0 L 100 80 Q 100 100 80 100 L 20 100 Q 0 100 0 80 Z\"/><path class=\"yellow-detail u-tips\" fill=\"#FFD23F\" d=\"M0 0H32V14H0ZM68 0H100V14H68Z\"/></svg></div><div class=\"incoming-sources\"><div class=\"pull-source\" data-source=\"0\"><span class=\"platform-shape lesson\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><strong>{{sources.lesson.label}}</strong></div><div class=\"pull-source\" data-source=\"1\"><span class=\"platform-shape podcast\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>{{sources.podcast.label}}</strong></div><div class=\"pull-source\" data-source=\"2\"><span class=\"platform-shape pending\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i></span><strong>{{sources.x.title}}</strong></div></div></div><div class=\"receipt-list\"><div class=\"source-receipt\"><span class=\"receipt-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span><div><strong>{{sources.lesson.label}}</strong><span>{{drafts.transcriptStatus}}</span></div></div><div class=\"source-receipt\"><span class=\"receipt-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span><div><strong>{{sources.podcast.label}}</strong><span>{{drafts.transcriptStatus}}</span></div></div><div class=\"source-receipt\"><span class=\"receipt-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><div><strong>{{sources.x.title}}</strong><span>Summary saved</span></div></div></div><p class=\"small-note\">X video saved with a summary. No transcript quoted.</p></div><div class=\"scene-links\"><a class=\"scene-deeper\" data-scene-link=\"3\" href=\"/how-it-works\">How capture works <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"scene-next\" href=\"#u-scen